1
00:00:00,143 --> 00:00:04,889
Part 2 mein hum Medoro Distribution ka account banayenge.

2
00:00:04,889 --> 00:00:11,299
Website se 7-day free trial shuru karenge, email verify karenge, aur sign-in,

3
00:00:11,299 --> 00:00:15,379
password recovery aur account security samjhenge.

4
00:00:16,323 --> 00:00:22,383
Sabse pehle official website kholte hain: medoro dot in slash distribution.

5
00:00:22,383 --> 00:00:26,908
Yeh live website hai, aur hum yahan sirf dekh rahe hain,

6
00:00:26,908 --> 00:00:30,383
koi account live server par nahi bana rahe.

7
00:00:31,044 --> 00:00:39,132
Hero section mein saaf likha hai: orders with credit control, batch-wise stock, schemes,

8
00:00:39,132 --> 00:00:43,543
GST invoices, picking, dispatch aur collections.

9
00:00:43,543 --> 00:00:50,528
Neeche likha hai, From ₹2,499 a month, aur trial mein har feature milta hai.

10
00:00:51,186 --> 00:00:59,080
Pricing section mein bhi likha hai: 7 days free, no card, aur plans apne-aap renew nahi hote.

11
00:00:59,080 --> 00:01:03,494
Yani trial ke liye koi payment details nahi chahiye.

12
00:01:04,152 --> 00:01:07,973
Ab Start 7-day free trial par click karte hain.

13
00:01:07,973 --> 00:01:11,226
Yeh distributor sign-up page kholta hai.

14
00:01:11,226 --> 00:01:18,543
Isi software ki ek alag copy hamare demo server par chal rahi hai, alag database ke saath.

15
00:01:18,543 --> 00:01:25,292
Wahan hum fictional data se account banayenge, taaki live system par kuch na badle.

16
00:01:25,954 --> 00:01:30,059
Yeh hai demo server par wahi sign-up page.

17
00:01:30,059 --> 00:01:33,187
Create your distributor account.

18
00:01:33,187 --> 00:01:36,217
Pehla step: apna email daaliye.

19
00:01:36,217 --> 00:01:40,518
Medoro is email par ek 6-digit code bhejega.

20
00:01:41,167 --> 00:01:45,612
Send code dabate hi code email par chala jata hai.

21
00:01:45,612 --> 00:01:48,723
Code 10 minute tak valid rehta hai.

22
00:01:49,392 --> 00:01:54,649
Demo server ka email ek authorised test inbox mein aata hai.

23
00:01:54,649 --> 00:01:57,015
Yeh raha verification code.

24
00:01:57,015 --> 00:02:01,484
Asli account mein yeh aapke apne inbox mein aayega.

25
00:02:02,144 --> 00:02:08,451
Wapas sign-up page par code daalte hain, aur Confirm and continue dabate hain.

26
00:02:08,451 --> 00:02:10,230
Email confirm ho gaya.

27
00:02:10,230 --> 00:02:16,780
Ab business details ka wizard khulta hai, jise hum agle part mein poora bharenge.

28
00:02:17,426 --> 00:02:23,375
Google se sign-up ka option tab dikhta hai jab server par Google sign-in configure ho.

29
00:02:23,375 --> 00:02:29,878
Is demo server par Google configure nahi hai, isliye hum email wala tareeka use kar rahe hain.
